    "text": "pullmanradio.com\nwebsite\nPullman\nHeald Hall At WSU To Be Demolished To Make Way For New Integrated Sciences Building\nBy Evan Ellis,\n9 hours agoHeald Hall at Washington State University is set to come down to make way for a new facility. The WSU Regents this month approved a 25 million dollar state funded project to demolish the building in the central part of campus on College Avenue. The demolition will begin in April and site prep for the new facility will continue into June of 2027. The new facility is called the Integrated Sciences Building.\n1",
